{"id":297,"name":"hariyama","speciesId":297,"dex":297,"form":"normal","generation":3,"types":["fighting"],"stats":{"hp":144,"attack":120,"defense":60,"special-attack":40,"special-defense":60,"speed":50},"abilities":[{"name":"thick-fat","hidden":false},{"name":"guts","hidden":false},{"name":"sheer-force","hidden":true}],"height":23,"weight":2538,"baseExp":166,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/297.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/297.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/297.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/297.ogg","genus":"Arm Thrust Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon de impulso de braço","flavor":[{"version":"emerald","text":"It has the habit of challenging others without hesitation to tests of strength. It’s been known to stand on train tracks and stop trains using forearm thrusts."},{"version":"ruby","text":"HARIYAMA practices its straight-arm slaps in any number of locations. One hit of this POKéMON’s powerful, openhanded, straight-arm punches could snap a telephone pole in two."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"HARIYAMA’s thick body may appear fat, but it is actually a hunk of solid muscle. If this POKéMON bears down and tightens all its muscles, its body becomes as hard as a rock."},{"version":"firered","text":"It stomps on the ground to build power. It can send a 10-ton truck flying with a straight-arm punch."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It loves challenging others to tests of strength. It has the power to stop a train with a slap."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Hariyama practices its straight-arm slaps in any number of locations. One hit of this Pokémon’s powerful, open